# fixture: transfer-exhausts-fallback  (adversarial)
#
# DOUBLE depletion on the TWO-SIDED path: an expense rule draws a Roth that
# runs dry in February 2026, and the backstop it spills to (Savings) runs
# dry in the same draw. execute() took the fallback to cover the whole
# shortfall, so $3,013 of the bill was neither paid nor reported unfunded.
# settlement-exhausts-fallback is the one-sided twin.

